2
00:00:09,460 --> 00:00:12,120
Here we are, we're at camp. It's the first night at summer camp.

3
00:00:12,620 --> 00:00:16,720
Seeing patrolers kind of looking around, checking out to make sure everybody's okay,

4
00:00:16,900 --> 00:00:22,020
and the scouts are doing well, and he notices one of the guys is having a little trouble walking

5
00:00:22,020 --> 00:00:26,560
and wondering if maybe he hurt himself or something like that.

6
00:00:26,560 --> 00:00:31,720
The guy goes over and talks to him and says, hey, I noticed that you, did you hurt your foot or something?

7
00:00:32,040 --> 00:00:35,180
And the boy says, oh, no, no, no, I'm fine.

8
00:00:36,320 --> 00:00:39,280
But it looks like you're having trouble walking.

9
00:00:39,400 --> 00:00:43,920
He says, well, it's kind of hard to wear all these socks at first, but I'll get used to it.

10
00:00:45,820 --> 00:00:48,980
And the senior patrol leader says, what do you mean wear all these socks?

11
00:00:48,980 --> 00:00:53,780
He says, well, the list of equipment for summer camp said we needed seven pairs of socks.

12
00:00:53,780 --> 00:01:01,240
And the senior patrol leader answered him and said, well, yeah, but you're not supposed to wear them all at once.

13
00:01:01,360 --> 00:01:08,120
And the scout said, well, what my plan is, is if I put on all seven pairs, I'll just take one pair off every day,

14
00:01:08,220 --> 00:01:10,740
and that way I won't have to worry about changing my socks.

15
00:01:13,140 --> 00:01:13,540
Yeah.

16
00:01:14,880 --> 00:01:15,260
Yeah.

17
00:01:15,960 --> 00:01:18,020
It's amazing the way they think, isn't it?

18
00:01:18,020 --> 00:01:20,320
But what an efficient plan.

